      "writtenOn": "2019-08-28T04:35:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes I\u0027ve checked it in i2c_start_cond and i2c_write_bit. And the spec seems doesn\u0027t care about arbitration lost during STOP condition.\n\nCurrently I\u0027m assuming EC is not the only master, so my plan is:\n  arbitration lost in start/write: do nothing, just return error\n  arbitration lost in stop: try reset the bus\n\nBut if we are pretty sure other devices are all slaves, I can do reset on all cases.",
      "parentUuid": "948fbd4b_a7f48ae8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 107,
        "startChar": 0,
