      "side": 1,
      "message": "Arbitration lost could happen in any place, not just start and stop. That\u0027s why i\u0027m saying you should check in all places where you pulse SCL just after releasing SDA. And of course, it\u0027s not for a real arbitration lost, but it\u0027ll provide hints if something\u0027s stalled and needs unwedging.",
